 pve-manager (9.2.22) trixie; urgency=medium
 
   * fix #8015: ui: upload and download from URL: let the user choose the
     format of '.img' images for import content, instead of always treating
     them as raw images. The '.img' extension is also used for other formats,
     for example by the qcow2 based Ubuntu cloud images, which were imported as
     raw disks that did not boot.
 
   * fix #6475: ui: upload: show only the name of the selected file, instead of
     the 'C:\fakepath\' path that browsers report on every platform.
